{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/f17a987bf8d40168c9e2c7b1071ad52f.avif?t=1756737901\" width=800 height=355 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KAWAII OR DIE </strong>(\u3065\u2022\u0300\u2a4a\u2022)\u3065\ufe3b\u2566\u0335\u0335\u033f\u2564\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WTF is an anime movement shooter where every PvP win fuels your <strong>long-term progression</strong> towards the ultimate mercenary army. Victories earn XP and currency to upgrade your waifu-run Mother Base, <strong>unlocking perks &amp; rare waifus</strong> you bring back into combat. Assign non-playable waifus to buildings for resources, <strong>deploy them on missions</strong>, and expand your tactical options. Each system feeds the next: shoot to build, build to upgrade, upgrade to dominate. Wrapped in a visual novel story, it\u2019s a <strong>genre hybrid</strong> where management, skill, and waifus drive everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/29baa0e31f14afa46c351515a5377355.avif?t=1756737901\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/2ea7f98503ba9126f9b4418e38d39a1d.poster.avif?t=1756737901\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/2ea7f98503ba9126f9b4418e38d39a1d.webm?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/2ea7f98503ba9126f9b4418e38d39a1d.mp4?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint, slide, dash, double jump around the map with AWM (Advance Waifu Mobility) in maps designed for high-speed navigation and vertical traversal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.poster.avif?t=1756737901\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.webm?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.mp4?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA net code with regional dedicated servers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for 60+ FPS on low-spec devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No intrusive live service bloat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/0b17c1ee57033f7af41fb8365303fcfd.avif?t=1756737901\" width=800 height=207 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.poster.avif?t=1756737901\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.webm?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.mp4?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble your Waifugatchi loadout</strong> from a growing pool of Waifu recruits, each offering unique tactical bonuses.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before a match, select your Waifugatchi squad. During the match, choose which mercenary Waifu's perks to activate between rounds, adjusting your strategy based on the flow of combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Begin with a small selection, then unlock new perks mid-match as the situation evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    No fixed builds. Every round presents fresh upgrade decisions that shape your path to victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/bf0a3d32b7da2eb3904c960eb6bab261.avif?t=1756737901\" width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/b4a50ae46760a8e9e0599cbf18361e10.poster.avif?t=1756737901\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/b4a50ae46760a8e9e0599cbf18361e10.webm?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/b4a50ae46760a8e9e0599cbf18361e10.mp4?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock &amp; recruit Waifu Mercenaries to assist you in battle and build out your Mother Base.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Mercenary Waifus to your Waifugatchi and get perk bonuses in matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign Mercenary Waifuss to combat and research facilities to grow your base power and unlock better Waifus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build additional facilities and customize your Mother Base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with, or invade, other player\u2019s Mother Bases to achieve world domination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/a9e849a53c6865c2f71f13d9cbc968cf.avif?t=1756737901\" width=800 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96e55980f55777a1803b09a38fc71497.poster.avif?t=1756737901\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96e55980f55777a1803b09a38fc71497.webm?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/96e55980f55777a1803b09a38fc71497.mp4?t=1756737901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime is hardcoded into WTF\u2019s DNA, as you orchestrate the rise of the world's largest Waifu Private Military Company in a visual novel style life sim.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2353050?t=1756737901","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/334f0fb6b9626886d6bf65797e384bfd6b1f5872/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756737901","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/216bc4fbfeb3d08506691929067842abdd0c9eca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756737901","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/216bc4fbfeb3d08506691929067842abdd0c9eca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756737901","categories":[{"description":